OL,3,GNEWSASir Jim Ratcliffe suspends
OL,4,Aproduction at key UK plants blaming
OL,5,Ahigh gas prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FBillionaire Sir Jim Ratcliffe's
OL,8,Findustrial giant Ineos is pausing
OL,9,Fproduction at its three plants in Hull,
OL,10,Fblaming high UK gas prices.
OL,12,FThe firm said gas prices in the UK are
OL,13,Ftwelve times higher than in the US, and
OL,14,Feight times more expensive than the
OL,15,Fcoal-based processes used by Chinese
OL,16,Fcompetitors.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
