OL,3,GNEWSASir Jim Ratcliffe suspends
OL,4,Aproduction at key UK plants blaming
OL,5,Ahigh gas prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Jim said: "We are being forced to
OL,8,Fmothball some of the most efficient
OL,9,Fplants in Europe, but with gas prices
OL,10,Fnow 12 times the level in the US and 8
OL,11,Ftimes that of China, we just cannot
OL,12,Fcompete."
OL,14,FThe facilities produce raw materials
OL,15,Fused to make pharmaceuticals, clothing,
OL,16,Fcosmetics, detergents, construction
OL,17,Fmaterials and military explosives in
OL,18,Fthe UK and Europe. Gas is a key
OL,19,Fingredient in production.
